=============== ACCESS =================
 
If you have gopher, the archive is browsable with the command:
   gopher -p CAF gopher.eff.org
 
The archive is also accessible via anonymous ftp. Ftp to
ftp.eff.org (192.77.172.4). It is in directory pub/CAF.
For more information or to make contributions, contact J.S. Greenfield
(greeny@eff.org).
